5,0,1,talk,Servas,,Good day to you all. Let us approach this game with calm hearts and open minds.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's just proceed carefully.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,May,,Hello everyone! I'm sure this will be exciting. Who's feeling nervous?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to be here. I hope for a peaceful discussion.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm going to find the werewolf for sure!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Patience is a virtue, Sakura. The truth often reveals itself to those who listen.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
