12,0,2,talk,May,,"You're so serious, Servas! But that's what makes you charming.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,pass,Jonathan,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,I can't be patient! I want to start guessing already!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,Let us observe each other's behavior. The wolf often hides in plain sight.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,That's true. We should be cautious about who we trust.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
