31,1,1,talk,Servas,,The first day has arrived. Has anyone noticed anything unusual in the silence of the night?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Not particularly. It's still too early to draw conclusions.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,May,,I'm dying to know if our Seer found anything juicy! Any volunteers?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I have some information, but I must be careful how I reveal it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh! Jonathan knows something! Tell us, tell us!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Jonathan, if you are the Seer, your guidance could save us, provided it is timed correctly.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"If the Seer speaks too early, the werewolf will just target them next.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,May,,Misaki is so practical. But where's the fun in being too safe?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I believe it is better to be direct. Sakura is the werewolf.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"What?! No way! Jonathan, you're lying! I'm just a kid!","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"A bold claim. @Sakura, how do you respond to this accusation beyond your surprise?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"It's a very direct claim. If Jonathan is the Seer, the evidence is clear.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,May,,"Wow, Jonathan! I didn't expect you to be so aggressive. I love it!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is not aggression, but a statement of fact based on my divination.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm not the werewolf! Jonathan is just trying to trick everyone!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,The evidence provided by the Seer is usually our strongest weapon. I trust Jonathan.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. It's logical to follow the Seer's lead.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,May,,"Well, if everyone is voting for the little one, I guess I will too! Sorry, Sakura!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I am sorry it had to be this way, Sakura.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,This is so unfair! You're all meanies!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
